    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afffd6e558498d49cae721e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与草上飞之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d98c9c068b4bca36648fe97954a33cbe05bc4e9ef65617a9f6d44775502ea23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
