      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了做好准备，\n我比草上飞早了一步来到操场──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1207da0bd4e28b67d60f831222c37ddbda0b9de4bd7b047b35ea57c8ae87a4e0",
